#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2188
ABUELA TUERCA: LLEGASTE\nLEJOS, EH.\nARRIBA DE LA TORRE ESTA\nEL CAMPEON. NO TE VOY A\nMENTIR: SU ROBOT ES MEJOR\nQUE EL TUYO.\nPERO EL NO ARMO EL SUYO.\nSE LO ARMARON.	GRANNY COG: YOU GOT FAR,\nDID YOU NOT.\nUP THAT TOWER IS THE\nCHAMPION. I WILL NOT LIE\nTO YOU: HIS ROBOT IS\nBETTER THAN YOURS.\nBUT HE DID NOT BUILD IT.\nIT WAS BUILT FOR HIM.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2296
CHATARRERO MAYOR:\nTODO ESTO ERAN ROBOTS\nCOMO EL TUYO.\nCADA UNO CREYO QUE ERA\nDISTINTO.\nA VER VOS.	CHIEF SCRAPPER:\nALL OF THIS WAS ROBOTS\nLIKE YOURS.\nEVERY ONE OF THEM THOUGHT\nIT WAS DIFFERENT.\nLET US SEE ABOUT YOU.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2337
ULTIMO TRAMO.\nDE ACA NO SE VUELVE\nIGUAL QUE COMO SE VINO.	THE LAST STRETCH.\nNOBODY COMES BACK FROM\nHERE THE SAME WAY THEY\nWENT UP.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2373
PRISMA\nAL NORTE: LA TORRE.\nSUBEN MUCHOS. BAJAN\nBASTANTES MENOS.	PRISM\nNORTH: THE TOWER.\nMANY GO UP. RATHER FEWER\nCOME DOWN.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2377
CHICO: MI HERMANA SUBIO\nAYER. TODAVIA NO BAJO.\nDICE MAMA QUE NO ME\nPREOCUPE.	KID: MY SISTER WENT UP\nYESTERDAY. SHE HAS NOT\nCOME DOWN.\nMUM SAYS NOT TO WORRY.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2381
GUARDIA: DOS PISOS Y LA\nCUMBRE.\nREPARA ANTES DE SUBIR.\nARRIBA NO HAY BANCO.	GUARD: TWO FLOORS AND\nTHE SUMMIT.\nREPAIR BEFORE YOU GO UP.\nTHERE IS NO BENCH UP\nTHERE.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2411
EL ULTIMO BANCO ANTES\nDE LA TORRE.\nUsalo bien.	THE LAST BENCH BEFORE\nTHE TOWER.\nUse it well.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2414
TENDERO: LLEVA TODO LO\nQUE PUEDAS PAGAR.\nArriba no se compra nada.	SHOPKEEPER: TAKE\nEVERYTHING YOU CAN PAY\nFOR. Nothing is sold up\nthere.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2417
ABUELA TUERCA: BUENO.\nHASTA ACA TE ACOMPANO.\nACORDATE DE UNA COSA\nSOLA: EL ROBOT QUE VAS A\nPELEAR ES EL QUE VOS\nARMASTE.\nNINGUNA PIEZA TE LA\nREGALARON.\nANDA.	GRANNY COG: RIGHT.\nTHIS IS AS FAR AS I GO.\nREMEMBER ONE THING ONLY:\nTHE ROBOT YOU ARE ABOUT\nTO FIGHT WITH IS THE ONE\nYOU BUILT.\nNOBODY GAVE YOU A SINGLE\nPART OF IT.\nGO ON.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2522
CAMPEON:\nTE VI SUBIR PISO POR\nPISO. NO SALTEASTE\nNINGUNO.\nESO YA TE HACE DISTINTO\nA CASI TODOS.\nAHORA VEAMOS EL ROBOT.	CHAMPION:\nI WATCHED YOU COME UP\nFLOOR BY FLOOR. YOU DID\nNOT SKIP ONE.\nTHAT ALREADY MAKES YOU\nDIFFERENT FROM ALMOST\nEVERYONE.\nNOW LET US SEE THE ROBOT.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2529
GUARDIANA DE LA CUMBRE:\nESE SILLON DE METAL ES\nDEL CAMPEON.\nTODAVIA NO ES TUYO.	SUMMIT KEEPER:\nTHAT METAL CHAIR BELONGS\nTO THE CHAMPION.\nIT IS NOT YOURS YET.

#: apps/chatarra/main/ch_zonas.c:2532
GUARDIANA: SENTATE, DALE.\nTE LO GANASTE.\nDESDE ACA SE VE TODO:\nEL PARAMO, LA CIUDAD,\nEL VALLE, EL PUERTO.\nY ALLA LEJOS, CHIQUITO,\nVILLA TUERCA.\nTU ROBOT NO SE PARECE EN\nNADA AL QUE TE ARMO LA\nABUELA.\nNI UNA PIEZA.\nFIN.	KEEPER: GO ON, SIT DOWN.\nYOU EARNED IT.\nFROM UP HERE YOU SEE IT\nALL: THE WASTELAND, THE\nCITY, THE VALLEY, THE\nPORT.\nAND FAR AWAY, TINY,\nCOGVILLE.\nYOUR ROBOT LOOKS NOTHING\nLIKE THE ONE GRANNY BUILT\nYOU.\nNOT ONE PART.\nTHE END.

